Search: Added *Content RAG* – semantic search and source-referenced answer generation over Mesh content (enterprise feature, disabled by default). Content is chunked and stored in dedicated `…-ragchunk-…` indices as part of the standard search sync; vectorization is handled by an Elasticsearch ingest pipeline. Included schemas and fields are controlled via the existing `elasticsearch` settings (`rag: true|false`, `rag.fields`) and `noIndex`. Permissions are derived from the requesting user's Mesh token.
See "Content RAG":https://www.gentics.com/mesh/docs/content-rag/ in the documentation for details.
